 "notes": [
  "Facing north (-Z). Origin at feet centre. 1 grid square = 1 texture pixel = 1/16 block. Hitbox 1.4 x 2.6 x 1 blocks; pauldrons, the glaive and its blade reach past it.",
  "An old Warden-order armour suit with nobody inside: the gaps at the neck, waist and joints show dark void with violet specks. The splinter floats where the heart was.",
  "Bones (15): root > body > faulds, cloak, splinter; body > helm > crest; body > arm_l > forearm_l > lantern; body > arm_r > forearm_r > glaive; body > leg_l, leg_r. Parts can drift slightly apart in idle, like the suit is barely held together.",
  "Animations: spawn (armour pieces fly together), idle (hover-bob, lantern sways), walk, attack (glaive sweep), hurt (plates rattle), death (pieces fall apart, the splinter drops), ability_call_adds (raises the lantern), ability_shield_phase (loop: plates lock, wisps orbit), ability_targeted_aoe (glaive slam)."
 ],
